      ],
      "source": "https://www.east-texas.com/bridge-city-texas.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s borders run along the Neches River and Cow Bayou, placing it right on the Gulf of Mexico’s inland waterways.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridge_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bridge City sits 100 miles east of Houston, within the Beaumont–Port Arthur Metropolitan Statistical Area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
